				],
				"body": {"mode": "raw", "raw": "{\n    \"amount\": 3000.0,\n    \"description\": \"Deposito E2E\",\n    \"channel\": \"WEB\"\n}"},
				"url": {"raw": "{{base_url}}/api/accounts/{{account_id_savings}}/deposits", "host": ["{{base_url}}"], "path": ["api", "accounts", "{{account_id_savings}}", "deposits"]},
				"description": "Deposita S/3,000 en la cuenta SAVINGS. Saldo esperado: S/4,000 (1000 inicial + 3000 depósito).\n\n**Endpoint:** POST /api/accounts/{id}/deposits\n**Respuesta esperada:** Status 200 o 201"
			},
